WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.357
Hello, game builder! Games need players to tap and play. Let’s learn the tap start block.

2
00:00:08.957 --> 00:00:15.843
The yellow “start on tap” block runs a script when you tap the character.

3
00:00:16.443 --> 00:00:20.287
The green flag starts the whole game.

4
00:00:20.287 --> 00:00:23.261
Tapping starts one character’s script.

5
00:00:23.861 --> 00:00:30.313
In games, players tap characters to make them do things — that’s interaction!

6
00:00:30.913 --> 00:00:36.496
One character can have a flag script AND a tap script.

7
00:00:37.096 --> 00:00:43.983
Use 👆 start on tap. When tapped, the cat hops and says “Hee hee!”.

8
00:00:43.983 --> 00:00:48.696
Tap → hop → giggle. Your first game interaction!

9
00:00:49.296 --> 00:00:53.139
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

10
00:00:53.139 --> 00:00:58.287
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
